OL,3,GNEWSAE-scooter rider suffers
OL,4,Alife-threatening injuries
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 18-year-old man has suffered
OL,7,F"life-threatening injuries" in a
OL,8,Fincident involving an electric scooter
OL,9,Fin Bradford.
OL,11,FThe single-vehicle crash happened on
OL,12,FCanterbury Avenue at about 19:35 BST on
OL,13,FThursday, West Yorkshire Police said.
OL,15,FThe force said the rider was taken to
OL,16,FLeeds General Infirmary for treatment,
OL,17,Fwith inquiries into the circumstances
OL,18,Fof the incident continuing.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
