OL,3,GNEWSAE-scooter rider suffers
OL,4,Alife-threatening injuries
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers have appealed for witnesses,
OL,7,Fincluding anyone who saw the e-scooter
OL,8,Fbefore the collision or who may have
OL,9,Ffootage of the crash, to come forward.
